DreamWidgetNavigation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#DreamWidgetNavigation
    src   "Per-widget navigation rules -- the panel UMG puts on every UWidget and this framework had nowhere.\n\nBefore this, every navigation rule lived on UUISelectable: a widget without one could hold focus\n(UDreamWidget::SetFocus and bIsFocusable have always existed) and then could not be navigated away\nfrom, to, or past, because the pipeline resolves a move by walking up from the focused widget\nlooking for a component that implements IDreamNavigationInterface and only UUISelectable did. A\nborder, a panel, a custom image with a click handler -- anything that is focusable without being a\nbutton -- was outside navigation entirely.\n\nThis is that component, carrying nothing but the rules, so any widget can join by having one. Put\nit on a widget that already has a UUISelectable too: a rule set here outranks the selectable's own\nper-direction mode, which keeps \"which component answers first\" from being a question anyone has\nto care about.\n\nReachable from Blueprint and from the details panel; UDreamWidget::GetOrCreateNavigation is the\none-liner for code that wants to set a rule on a widget that has no navigation yet."
    text  "逐控件导航规则——UMG 为每个 UWidget 提供的面板，而本框架此前无处安放。\n\n在此之前，所有导航规则都位于 UUISelectable 上：没有该组件的控件也能持有焦点\n（UDreamWidget::SetFocus 和 bIsFocusable 一直存在），而随后却无法从它导航离开、\n导航到它或越过它，因为管线在解析一次移动时，会从持有焦点的控件向上查找\n实现了 IDreamNavigationInterface 的组件，而只有 UUISelectable 做到了。边框、\n面板、带点击处理程序的自定义图像——任何可聚焦却并非按钮的东西\n——都完全在导航之外。\n\n这就是那个组件，只承载规则，因此任何控件只要拥有它就能加入。\n也可以把它放在已经有 UUISelectable 的控件上：在这里设置的规则优先于 selectable 自身的\n逐方向模式，这样“哪个组件先应答”就不再是\n需要任何人操心的问题。\n\n可从蓝图和细节面板访问；UDreamWidget::GetOrCreateNavigation 是\n为尚无导航的控件设置规则的代码的一行式写法。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetNavigation:bCanNavigateHere {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#DreamWidgetNavigation:bCanNavigateHere
    src   "Can navigation land here? Independent of the rules above, which are about leaving.\n\nDefaults to true, and is and-ed with the widget being focusable, visible and interactable --\nthe questions UUISelectable asks of itself, so a navigation-only widget and a button are judged\nalike. A widget whose bIsFocusable was turned off is no landing spot for either: SetFocus refuses it."
    text  "导航可以落在这里吗？与上述关于离开的规则无关。\n\n默认值为 true，并与控件是否可聚焦、可见且可交互进行与运算——\n这些正是 UUISelectable 对自身提出的问题，因此仅有导航的控件和按钮会得到\n相同的判定。bIsFocusable 被关闭的控件对两者都不是落点：SetFocus 会拒绝它。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetNavigation:HasAnyRule {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#DreamWidgetNavigation:HasAnyRule
    src   "True when any of the six directions was given a rule. What decides who answers a move."
    text  "当六个方向中任意一个被设置了规则时为 true。决定由谁应答一次移动。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetNavigation:HasRuleFor {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#DreamWidgetNavigation:HasRuleFor
    src   "True when the author said something about InDirection -- anything but the Escape default.\n\nThis is what makes co-existing with UUISelectable unambiguous: an untouched block means \"I have\nno opinion\", and the selectable's own mode is left to answer."
    text  "当作者对 InDirection 做了设置时为 true——只要不是默认的 Escape。\n\n正是这一点让与 UUISelectable 的共存毫无歧义：未改动的块表示“我没有意见”，\n由 selectable 自身的模式来应答。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetNavigation:SetAllNavigationRules {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#DreamWidgetNavigation:SetAllNavigationRules
    src   "The same rule in all six directions at once -- UMG's SetAllNavigationRules.\n\nInWidgetToFocus is only meaningful for Explicit, where it names a widget inside this widget's\nown tree; it is written for every direction regardless, exactly as UMG does, so that switching\nthe rule to Explicit afterwards finds the name already there."
    text  "一次性为全部六个方向设置相同的规则——即 UMG 的 SetAllNavigationRules。\n\nInWidgetToFocus 仅对 Explicit 有意义，此时它指定的是此控件自身\n树中的某个控件；但无论如何它都会写入每个方向，与 UMG 的做法完全一致，这样之后\n把规则切换为 Explicit 时，名称已经在那里了。"
    state machine
}

