DreamWidgetNavigation:SetNavigationRuleCustomBoundary {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#DreamWidgetNavigation:SetNavigationRuleCustomBoundary
    src   "Bind a delegate that is asked only at the edge -- UMG's SetNavigationRuleCustomBoundary.\n\nSame delegate slot as SetCustomDelegate; the rule is what decides whether it is asked for every\nmove or only for the one that leaves the area. An unbound delegate clears back to Escape, as\nthe plain custom setter does, so \"unbind\" never leaves a rule pointing at nothing."
    text  "绑定一个只在边缘处才会被询问的委托——即 UMG 的 SetNavigationRuleCustomBoundary。\n\n与 SetCustomDelegate 使用相同的委托槽位；由规则决定它是每次\n移动都被询问，还是只在离开区域的移动时被询问。未绑定的委托会恢复为 Escape，与\n普通的自定义设置函数一样，因此“解绑”绝不会让规则指向空。"
    state machine
}

