DreamWidgetNavigationData:WidgetToFocus {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#DreamWidgetNavigationData:WidgetToFocus
    src   "For Explicit: the display name of the widget to focus, resolved inside this widget's own tree.\n\nA NAME as well as a pointer because a text-authored .dui can only give a property an asset path,\nnever a sibling in the live tree -- the same limitation UISelectable's transition target ran\ninto. The pointer wins when both are set."
    text  "用于 Explicit：要聚焦的控件的显示名称，在此控件自身的树中解析。\n\n既用名称也用指针，因为文本编写的 .dui 只能给属性一个资产路径，\n永远无法给出活动树中的同级项——UISelectable 的过渡目标也曾遇到\n同样的限制。两者都设置时，指针优先。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUINavigationRule {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#EDreamUINavigationRule
    src   "What one direction does, per widget. The same five answers UMG's EUINavigationRule gives, and for\nthe same reasons -- this framework already copies UMG's class model, so navigation authoring that\nlooked different would be a second thing to learn for no gain."
    text  "每个控件在某个方向上的行为。与UMG的EUINavigationRule给出的五种答案相同，原因也相同——\n本框架已经沿用了UMG的类模型，所以如果导航的编写方式看起来不一样，\n那就成了第二件要学的东西，毫无收益。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUINavigationRule.Custom {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#EDreamUINavigationRule:Custom
    src   "Ask the delegate. For lists and grids, where the answer is a computation and not a link."
    text  "询问委托。用于列表和网格，这类地方的答案是计算出来的，而不是一条链接。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUINavigationRule.CustomBoundary {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#EDreamUINavigationRule:CustomBoundary
    src   "Run the ordinary scan, and ask the delegate only when the move would LEAVE the surrounding\nnavigation area -- UMG's CustomBoundary.\n\nThe difference from Custom is which moves the delegate hears about. Custom is asked for every\nmove in that direction, so a list's own row-to-row stepping has to be written into it as well.\nCustomBoundary is asked only at the edge, which is the interesting case and usually the only\none an author has an answer for: \"when Down runs off the bottom of this page, go to the next\npage\" leaves the scan to do the rows.\n\nLast in the enum on purpose: the values above it are serialized in existing assets."
    text  "执行常规扫描，只有当移动会离开所在的\n导航区域时才询问委托——即UMG的CustomBoundary。\n\n与Custom的区别在于委托会收到哪些移动。Custom会针对该方向上的每一次\n移动被询问，所以列表自身的行间步进也必须写进去。\nCustomBoundary只在边缘处被询问，而这正是有意思的情形，通常也是\n编写者唯一有答案的情形：“当Down从本页底部跑出去时，转到下一\n页”，把行的事情留给扫描。\n\n故意放在枚举最后：它上面的值已在现有资产中序列化。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUINavigationRule.Escape {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetNavigation.h#EDreamUINavigationRule:Escape
    src   "The default: let the framework's directional scan answer, including out of this area."
    text  "默认：由框架的方向扫描给出答案，包括移出此区域的情况。"
    state machine
}

